MAIN

PRINT CALL BEGIN
MOVE TEMP 2 BEGIN
MOVE TEMP 3 HALLOCATE 4
MOVE TEMP 4 HALLOCATE 4
HSTORE TEMP 3 0 NestedIfTest_TestNested
MOVE TEMP 5 4
L0	CJUMP LE TEMP 5 3 L1
HSTORE PLUS TEMP 4 TEMP 5 0 0
MOVE TEMP 5 PLUS TEMP 5 4
JUMP L0
L1 HSTORE TEMP 4 0 TEMP 3
RETURN TEMP 4
END

HLOAD TEMP 6 TEMP 2 0
HLOAD TEMP 7 TEMP 6 0
RETURN TEMP 7
END ( TEMP 2 )
END

NestedIfTest_TestNested [ 1 ]
BEGIN

MOVE TEMP 1 10

MOVE TEMP 2 5
CJUMP LE TEMP 1 15 L3
CJUMP MINUS 1 LE TEMP 1 15 L2
 
L2 
PRINT 1

CJUMP LE TEMP 2 10 L6
CJUMP MINUS 1 LE TEMP 2 10 L5
 
L5 
PRINT 2

 JUMP L7
L6 
PRINT 3


L7 NOOP

 JUMP L4
L3 
PRINT 4


L4 NOOP

RETURN 0
END

